#===FILEINFO:VERSION_CREATED:25.1.1 LAST_VERSION_MODIFIED:25.1.1===
#
# Translators Parameters 
#
# The following commented keywords (without postfix), refer to all corresponding keywords listed bellow based on different translator-format combinations
# TRANSL_REPRESENTATION : If both 2D and 3D Representations are present in a neutral file, decide which representation to choose. [ COMPARE, FORCE2D, FORCE3D ] 
# TRANSL_FLATTEN_ASSEMBLIES : Create one ANSA file for the whole assembly
# TRANSL_PREVIEW : Read only the hierarchy, not the geometry
# TRANSL_NAME_BASED_INSTANTIATION : Import assemblies/parts with the same name as instances
# TRANSL_SINGLE_PART : Create a single part from a whole assembly
# TRANSL_DIRECTORIES : Specify extra search directories
# TRANSL_HIDDEN : Read hidden entities
# TRANSL_LAYER_VIS : Read CATIA v4 visible layers
# TRANSL_INCLUDE_CATEGORIES : Include the layers of the specified categories
# TRANSL_INCLUDE_LAYERS : Include the specified layers
# TRANSL_INCLUDE_NAMED_LAYERS : Include the specified layers
# TRANSL_EXCLUDE_LAYERS : Exclude the specified layers
# TRANSL_EXCLUDE_NAMED_LAYERS : Exclude the specified layers
# TRANSL_FREE_GEOMETRY : Read free geometry
# TRANSL_ATTRIBUTES : Read attributes
# TRANSL_ANNOTATIONS : Read annotations
# TRANSL_GEOMSETS_HIERARCHY : Create geometric sets hierarchy
# TRANSL_PUBLICATIONS : Read publications
# TRANSL_GEOM_SETS : Read geometric sets
# TRANSL_FILTERS_STATUS : Available options: all || default || inclusive || match_first || exclude
# TRANSL_FILTERS_INCLUSIVE : Match layer filters
# TRANSL_FILTERS_OR : Match first non empty filter
# TRANSL_FILTERS_EXCLUDE : Exclude layer filters
# TRANSL_REFERENCE_SETS_STATUS : Available options: all || model || inclusive || match_first || exclude
# TRANSL_REFERENCE_SETS_INCLUSIVE : Match reference sets
# TRANSL_REFERENCE_SET_OR : Match first non empty reference set
# TRANSL_REFERENCE_SET_EXCLUDE : Exclude reference sets
# TRANSL_READ_MODE : Available options: both || geometry || facetted_data
# TRANSL_GEOM_MODE : Available options: both || solids || shells
# TRANSL_FACETTED_DATA : Available options: FACETS, POINTS, CURVES
# TRANSL_LOD : Available options: the number of the specific LOD (or -1 for all LODs)
# TRANSL_WIREFRAME : Read the Wireframe data of the model
# TRANSL_PMI_COORDINATE_SYSTEMS : Read Product Manufactoring Information Coordinate Systems as ANSA Coordinate Systems.
# TRANSL_PMI_REFERENCE_POINTS : Read Product Manufacturing Information Reference Points as ANSA Points.
# TRANSL_PMI_NOTES : Read Product Manufacturing Information Notes as ANSA Annotations.
# TRANSL_PMI_SPOTWELDS : Read Product Manufacturing Information Spotwelds as ANSA Connections.
# TRANSL_LOAD_PARTS : Translate only the specified parts
# TRANSL_GENERATE_3D_CURVES : Shared parameters
# TRANSL_CONSTRUCTION_SURFACES : Untrim unused surfaces
# TRANSL_ANSACOLOR : Let ANSA choose the PID colors
# TRANSL_BODY2PID : Create PIDs from bodies
# TRANSL_LAYER2PID : Create PIDs from layers
# TRANSL_COLOR2PID : Create PIDs from colors
# TRANSL_SHELL2PID : Create PIDs from shells
# TRANSL_NAME2PID : Create PIDs from face names
# TRANSL_PART2PID : Create PIDs from parts
# TRANSL_SINGLEPID : Create a single PID
# TRANSL_CREATE_VOLUMES : Create volumes from closed bodies
# TRANSL_REMOVE_HOLLOWS : One volume will be created for each body
# TRANSL_CREATE_SETS : Create sets
# TRANSL_ORIENT_VEC : Use orientation vector
# TRANSL_THICKNESS_LINES : Use thickness lines for orientation
# TRANSL_MATERIAL_VECTOR : Use named curve as material vector
# TRANSL_EXTERN_HEAL : Heal the model
# TRANSL_FEATURE_MODE : Read features
# TRANSL_PERFORM_TOPOLOGY : CAD input Topology
# TRANSL_TOPO_BETWEEN_LAYERS : Perform topology between PIDs
# TRANSL_TOPO_BETWEEN_PARTS : Perform topology between parts
# TRANSL_RESPECT_FILE_TOPO : Respect file topology
# TRANSL_GEOMETRY_CLEAN_UP : CAD input Topology
# TRANSL_PERFORM_FACETS_TOPOLOGY : Perform topology among common facet vertices
# TRANSL_TIMEOUT : Terminate translation after given minutes
#
# Settings for CATIA with CT
